[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0010","text":"要点什么—？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0011","text":"客人1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0020","text":"哇……嗯—……\n中份薯条和……鸡块还有────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0030","text":"（两个人都不太擅长接待客人啊……\n　但至少练过一遍了……希望她们能加油……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0040","text":"奶昔和────\n再来个微笑什么的…………能点吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0050","text":"微笑服务？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0060","text":"啊……笑容……\n抱歉，我好像忘了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0070","text":"免费服务"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0071","text":"客人2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0080","text":"我、我也要……！\n可以给我100个笑容吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0081","text":"客人3"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0090","text":"这、这边也……！\n免费服务什么的太不敢当了，我会付钱的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_02_0100","text":"…………\n怎么又变成平时的粉丝服务现场了…………"}]
